      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/styles/session-grid.css",
      "content": "The 44 px minimum only covers inputs and buttons. A row containing only plain values, missing Marks, or “Not held” spans has no `.session-grid-control`, so it can still shrink below 44 px (the inherited table-cell rule only adds 0.25rem vertical padding). Apply a touch-screen row/cell height to the Review grid as well, scoped so Price History remains unchanged, and test a row without controls.",
      "existing_code": "  .session-grid-control {\n    min-height: 44px;\n  }",
      "start_line": 51,
      "end_line": 53,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/styles/session-grid.css",
      "content": "Pressable values lose their gain/loss color: `cellView` puts `tone` on the parent `\u003ctd\u003e`, but `.session-grid-control` explicitly sets `color: var(--ink)` on the button. Thus a cell with both `id` and `tone: 'gain'` or `'loss'` renders in the normal ink color instead of the existing semantic color. Set `color: inherit` on `.session-grid-press` so selectable values retain their tone.",
      "suggestion_code": "button.session-grid-press {\n  width: auto;\n  border-color: transparent;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}",
      "existing_code": "button.session-grid-press {\n  width: auto;\n  border-color: transparent;\n  background: transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}",
